data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Now I understand the campaign. I need to:\n1. Create a /tmp/readback.json with the exact JSON format\n2. Include member, role, branch, missing array, goal, scope, obligations\n\nLet me parse:\n- member: qa\n- role: agent\n- branch: cs-sandbox/<QA:1>.<GROUP:1>\n- missing: [] (check-inputs says all 2 listed inputs present, 0 snapshots present - so no missing inputs)\n\nNow I need to write goal, scope, obligations in my own words based on the briefing.\n\nGoal: Verify the developer's implementation against the orchestrator's design in my own hello-app clone and report the results.\n\nScope: I own QA verification and reporting in ~/hello-app and ~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output; I must not modify the application code or fetch/push git refs myself.\n\nOligations: I must read DESIGN.md, run the build/serve commands, check the interface against the design including the design system usage, commit any durable results to my branch and output directory, and reply with my findings; if I do not reply and commit, the work is lost or unseen.\n\nLet me write the file and reply."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789958803,"id":"chatcmpl-b07154e166e143b3944328f5bd52ad7a","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

